[en.FOCUS_GEN_INDUSTRY_HYGIENE]
Wash!

[en.FOCUS_GEN_INDUSTRY_HYGIENE_desc]
So, grab your hazmat suits and don’t forget your hoof sanitizer, for in Equestria, germs shall be banished to the darkest depths of Tartarus.

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_INDUSTRY_HYGIENE]
洗！

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_INDUSTRY_HYGIENE_desc]
所以，抓住你的防护服，别忘了你的蹄部消毒剂，因为在小马利亚，细菌将被驱逐到塔尔塔洛斯的最黑暗深处。

